sequenceDiagram
    actor A as 客户端A (房主)
    actor B as 客户端B (加入者)
    participant CC as Cloud Code (C#)
    participant Lobby as UGS Lobby
    participant CS as UGS Cloud Save
    participant Push as UGS Player Messages

    Note over A,Push: === 阶段1: 创建房间 (HostGame) ===
    A->>A: 点击 Create Room 按钮
    A->>CC: CloudCode.HostGame()
    CC->>Lobby: CreateLobbyAsync(maxPlayers=2)
    Lobby-->>CC: LobbyId + LobbyCode (6位)
    CC->>CS: SetCustomItemBatchAsync(board=FEN, whitePlayerId=A.Id)
    CC-->>A: return LobbyCode
    A->>A: 显示6位房间码, 等待对手...

    Note over A,Push: === 阶段2: 加入房间 (JoinGame) ===
    B->>B: 输入房间码, 点击 Join
    B->>CC: CloudCode.JoinGame(lobbyCode)
    CC->>Lobby: JoinLobbyByCodeAsync(code, B)
    Lobby-->>CC: Lobby数据

    alt JoinLobbyByCode 抛出异常
        CC->>Lobby: GetJoinedLobbiesAsync()
        Lobby-->>CC: 已有房间列表
        CC->>CS: GetCustomItemsAsync(board, whiteId, blackId)
        CS-->>CC: 已存储的FEN + 玩家ID
        CC-->>B: Rejoin(FEN, OpponentId, IsWhite)
    else 正常加入
        CC->>CC: 随机分配黑白方<br/>rng.NextDouble() >= 0.5
        CC->>CS: SetCustomItemBatchAsync(board=FEN, whiteId, blackId)
        CC->>Push: SendPlayerMessage("opponentJoined", B_info)
        Push->>A: Push: opponentJoined → OnGameStart(FEN)
        CC-->>B: JoinGameResponse(Session=FEN, IsWhite)
    end

    B->>B: 初始化UI, 进入游戏
    A->>A: OnGameStart(FEN) → 初始化UI, 进入游戏

    Note over A,Push: === 阶段3: 走棋同步 (MakeMove) ===
    A->>A: 玩家A选中 e2 棋子, 点击 e4 目标格
    A->>CC: CloudCode.MakeMove(session, from="e2", to="e4")

    CC->>CS: GetCustomItemsAsync(board, whiteId, blackId)
    CS-->>CC: FEN + player IDs
    CC->>CC: chessBoard.LoadFromFen(FEN)<br/>校验: turn == PieceColor.White?<br/>校验: IsValidMove("e2","e4")?

    alt 走法不合法
        CC-->>A: throw Exception("Invalid move")
    else 走法合法
        CC->>CC: chessBoard.Move(new Move("e2","e4"))
        CC->>CS: SetCustomItemAsync(board=new_FEN)
        CC->>CC: 检查 IsEndGame / EndgameType / WonSide
        CC->>Push: SendPlayerMessage("boardUpdated", BoardUpdateResponse)
        Push->>B: Push: boardUpdated (FEN + GameOver)
        CC-->>A: BoardUpdateResponse(board=FEN)
    end

    B->>B: OnBoardUpdate(FEN)<br/>SyncBoard(FEN)<br/>FindSanBetween(oldFEN, newFEN)<br/>moveHistoryUI.PushMove(SAN)
    B->>B: 切换到B的回合<br/>显示 "Your Turn"

    Note over A,Push: === 阶段4: 认输 (Resign) ===
    B->>B: 点击 Resign 按钮
    B->>CC: CloudCode.Resign(session)

    CC->>CS: GetCustomItemsAsync(board, whiteId, blackId)
    CS-->>CC: FEN + player IDs
    CC->>CC: chessBoard.Resign(PieceColor.Black)
    CC->>CS: SetCustomItemAsync(board=resigned_FEN)
    CC->>Push: SendPlayerMessage("boardUpdated", BoardUpdateResponse)
    Push->>A: Push: boardUpdated (GameOver=true, WonSide=White)
    CC-->>B: BoardUpdateResponse(board=FEN, GameOver=true)

    A->>A: OnBoardUpdate() → ShowGameOver("Black Resigns")
    B->>B: OnBoardUpdate() → ShowGameOver("You Resigned")

    Note over A,Push: === 排行榜提交 ===
    A->>A: CalculateOnlineScore(endgameType)<br/>SubmitOnlineScore()
    B->>B: SubmitOnlineScore()
